               <history>
                  <origin>
                     <origDate when-custom="14XX">s. xv</origDate>
                  </origin>
                  <provenance type="#i"><orgName role="fmo" key="mlgbOrg_67">Brecon, Brecknockshire.
                        Dominican convent</orgName><p>'Explicit serium senectutis . . . per
                        Fratrum Bartholomeum Texerii ordinis predicatorum. Degentem pro eo tempore
                        Brechonie eiusdem ordinis conuentu' (fol. 61v, end of art. 1).</p><p>Arts 1,
                        2 and first part of 3 are admirably written in one hand. Art. 3 is finished
                        off by another, and has a colophon, probably written by the scribe
                        Bartholomew, which ends '. . . quod B et M'.</p></provenance>
